  "title": "Easy Chourico Soup",
  "description": "Dried Portuguese chourico (or &#34;Soyrizo™&#34;, for vegetarians) gives a spicy and rich flavor to this exciting and colorful soup made with garbanzo beans, sweet potato, and fresh spinach.",
